    Bug 2005962 - Add function get(key) to messenger.messages.tags. r=mkmelin

    Extensions currently have to call `messages.tags.list()` and iterate through
    the returned array to find a tag by key. The new `messages.tags.get()` function
    provides a direct lookup.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291029

